    "quote": "As I spoke with them in Tokyo, I realized that the center of gravity in my notes was shifting. I had come to hear about \"a new approach to AI drug discovery,\" but as the conversation progressed, I began to feel this was not merely about technological evolution — it was a matter that could ripple into national resilience.",
